@startuml
title Direct-Adapter Gate - Detail

skinparam shadowing false

start
:Load direct adapter;
:Run bounded greeting
and representative DFIR prompts;
:Inspect stop ID, repetition,
template leakage, and usability;
if (All checks pass?) then (yes)
  :Preserve enforcing evidence;
  :Eligible for evaluation;
else (no)
  :Reject candidate;
  :Preserve diagnostic artifacts;
endif
stop

@enduml
